446 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dream Phase\072 Feature Brainstorming\nGoal\072\050Come up with as many feature ideas as possible to help someone feeling uncertain about their career feel informed\054 empowered and supported\056\nHow to Use This Space\072\nUse sticky notes to share any idea \024 big\054 small\054 wild\054 or practical\056\nThink about\072\nWhat questions do people need help answering about their career and next steps\077\nWhat kind of tool would actually help them make informed decisions\077\nWhat can technology uniquely solve in navigating career paths and skill development\077\nGo beyond your track\nDevs can suggest UX\054 UXers can suggest AI\054 DS folks can suggest product features\056\nThink from your user\031s shoes\nYou\031re uncertain\054 overwhelmed\054 possibly financially stressed\056\nYou want clarity\054 speed\054 and empathy\056\nPrompts to Help You Think\072\nWhat would a first\055time visitor want to see immediately\077\nIf this were a chatbot\054 what could it say or do to guide the user\077\nWhat information could be predicted or suggested from available data\077\nHow can we help someone make a career decision confidently\077\nWhat\031s the one thing someone feeling uncertain needs to find fast\077\nAdd your ideas as one sticky \075 one feature\050 We\047ll sort and prioritize these next\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 447 0 R
     /Pg 416 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
